    "### Q6: Using your finalized Phase I estimate of $\\bar{p}$, report the center line and control limits you will carry forward into Phase II."
   ]
  },The finalized Phase I estimate (after removing Week 14) is p̄ = 0.0516.

Center line: 0.0516
UCL: 0.0516 + 3√(0.0516(1 − 0.0516)/nᵢ)
LCL: max(0, 0.0516 − 3√(0.0516(1 − 0.0516)/nᵢ))

Because shipment size varies, the limits change each week.
